      Ports:
        Description:
          String: ""
        DescriptionText:
          ClassType1: TEXT
          String: |
            Cheap way of doing reflection and it’s not actually reflecting the scene it’s just using whatever is in that sampling spherical coordinates texture and it’s also sometimes referred to as material capture ("MatCap") reflection. The reference texture only stores one side of a sphere.
            
            Inputs:
            Matcap Reflection Texture - The Texture 2D Object Map use a reflection spherical map.
            Intensity - The strength of the reflection effect.
            Normal Map - Texture 2D Normal Map input.

        FirstTime:
          Variable: false
        Locked:
